#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-leap-16-0
#: opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"Input to a I<roff> system is in plain text interleaved with control lines "
"and escape sequences."
