"The command that should be used for this is specified by the B<print> "
"command in the device description file, see B<\\%groff_font>(5)."
msgstr ""
"Postprocesor używany dla danego urządzenia jest podawany komendą B<postpro> "
"w pliku opisu urządzenia; patrz B<\\%groff_font>(5)."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"If this command is not present, the output is piped into the B<lpr>(1)  "
"program by default."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "Pass I<arg> to the spooler program."
msgstr "Przekazuje I<arg> spoolerowi."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "Several arguments should be passed with a separate -L option each."
msgstr "Każdy argument powinien być przekazany w osobnej opcji -L."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid ""
"Note that B<groff> does not prepend \\[oq]-\\[cq] (a minus sign) to I<arg> "
"before passing it to the spooler program."
msgstr ""
"Proszę zauważyć, że B<groff> nie dołącza \\[oq]-\\[cq] (znaku minusa) do "
"I<arg> przed przekazaniem go spoolerowi."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "Don't allow newlines within I<eqn> delimiters."
msgstr "Nie zezwala na nowe linie z ogranicznikami I<eqn>."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "This is the same as the B<-N> option in B<eqn>."
msgstr "Jest to to samo, co opcja B<-N> w B<eqn>."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "Preprocess with B<pic>."
msgstr "Preprocesuje za pomocą B<pic>."

#. type: TP
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-P\\ >I<-option>"
msgstr "B<-P\\ >I<-opcja>"

#. type: TQ
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<-P\\ >I<-option>B<\\ -P\\ >I<arg>"
msgstr "B<-P\\ >I<-opcja>B<\\ -P\\ >I<arg>"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Pass I<-option> or I<-option\\~arg> to the postprocessor."
msgid "Pass I<-option> or I<-option\\ arg> to the postprocessor."
msgstr "Przekazuje I<-opcja> lub I<-opcja\\~arg> do postprocesora."

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "The option must be specified with the necessary preceding minus sign(s)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
msgid "or"
msgstr "lub"

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-bookworm mageia-cauldron
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Note that B<groff> does not prepend `-' (a minus sign) to I<arg> before "
